      "title": {
        "en": "Adjectives from food"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Polish makes an adjective from a noun with *-owy, -owa, -owe*: *malina* gives *malinowy* (*jogurt malinowy*), *truskawka* gives *truskawkowy*, and *jabłko* gives *jabłkowy* (*sok jabłkowy*, *ciasto jabłkowe*). The ending agrees with the noun, like any adjective."
      },
